# Backend build context (Dockerfile.backend, context: .)
#
# .env is excluded DELIBERATELY -- it holds real API keys. Docker COPY would
# bake it into an image layer permanently (recoverable from `docker history`
# even after a later layer "deletes" it). Secrets reach the container via
# docker-compose's `env_file:` at runtime instead, never via COPY.
.env
.env.*
!.env.template

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.git/
.gitignore

# Not needed inside the backend image
frontend/
qdrant_storage/
data/
eval_traces/
*.md
